{"id":"vd-a2-dads-first-marathon","level":"a2","n":2,"title":{"en":"Have You Ever Run a Marathon?","vi":"Bố đã bao giờ chạy marathon chưa?"},"summary":"Tối hôm bố tuyên bố sẽ chạy marathon, Chloe hỏi bố đã từng làm những gì — và bố thừa nhận là chưa bao giờ chạy quá năm cây số.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-dads-first-marathon","level":"a2","title":{"en":"Dad's First Marathon","vi":"Cuộc marathon đầu tiên của bố"}},"scene":{"background":"home-evening","props":[{"id":"tea","x":800}]},"cast":{"chloe":{"name":{"en":"Chloe","vi":"Chloe"},"look":"teengirl","x":500,"style":{"hair":"ponytail","hairColor":"#E0B45C","outfit":"tee","top":"#3F7FCB","topShade":"#2F66AA"}},"tom":{"name":{"en":"Dad","vi":"Bố"},"look":"dad","x":1130,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#8A6D45","outfit":"shirt","top":"#E9A23B","topShade":"#D18B28","collar":"#FFF7EE"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"tom","en":"Chloe, I've decided something. I'm going to run a marathon.","vi":"Chloe, bố quyết định rồi. Bố sẽ chạy marathon.","ipa":["ˈkloʊi","aɪv","ˌdɪˈsaɪdɪd","ˈsʌmθɪŋ","aɪm","ˈɡoʊɪŋ","tu","ɹʌn","ə","ˈmɛɹəˌθɑn"],"start":0.554,"end":5.014,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.107],[2,1.297],[3,1.841],[4,3.285],[5,3.557],[6,3.801],[7,3.937],[8,4.182],[9,4.263]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"A marathon? Dad, have you ever run a marathon?","vi":"Marathon á? Bố ơi, bố đã bao giờ chạy marathon chưa?","ipa":["ə","ˈmɛɹəˌθɑn","dæd","hæv","ju","ˈɛvɚ","ɹʌn","ə","ˈmɛɹəˌθɑn"],"start":5.804,"end":9.034,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,5.804],[1,5.861],[2,7.083],[3,7.464],[4,7.641],[5,7.79],[6,8.075],[7,8.266],[8,8.32]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"No, I've never run a marathon. That's why it's a challenge!","vi":"Chưa, bố chưa bao giờ chạy marathon. Chính vì thế mới là thử thách!","ipa":["noʊ","aɪv","ˈnɛvɚ","ɹʌn","ə","ˈmɛɹəˌθɑn","ðæts","waɪ","ɪts","ə","ˈtʃæləndʒ"],"start":9.824,"end":14.324,"expression":"happy","gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,9.824],[1,10.411],[2,10.642],[3,10.955],[4,11.172],[5,11.254],[6,12.902],[7,13.228],[8,13.432],[9,13.595],[10,13.676]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"Have you ever run ten kilometers?","vi":"Bố đã từng chạy mười cây số chưa?","ipa":["hæv","ju","ˈɛvɚ","ɹʌn","tɛn","kəˈlɑˌmʌtɚz"],"start":15.114,"end":17.084,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,15.114],[1,15.242],[2,15.419],[3,15.731],[4,15.949],[5,16.234]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Hmm… no. I've run five kilometers. Once.","vi":"Ừm… chưa. Bố từng chạy năm cây. Một lần.","ipa":["hm","noʊ","aɪv","ɹʌn","faɪv","kəˈlɑˌmʌtɚz","wʌns"],"start":17.874,"end":23.234,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,17.874],[1,18.393],[2,19.824],[3,20.123],[4,20.368],[5,20.748],[6,22.555]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"Dad! A marathon is forty-two kilometers!","vi":"Bố! Marathon dài bốn mươi hai cây số đấy!","ipa":["dæd","ə","ˈmɛɹəˌθɑn","ɪz","ˈfɔɹti-tu","kəˈlɑˌmʌtɚz"],"start":24.024,"end":27.144,"expression":"surprised","thoughtBubble":"number:42","timing":[[0,24.024],[1,24.859],[2,24.94],[3,25.538],[4,25.715],[5,26.285]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"I know. I've already made a training plan.","vi":"Bố biết. Bố đã lập xong kế hoạch tập luyện rồi.","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","aɪv","ɔlˈɹɛdi","meɪd","ə","ˈtɹeɪnɪŋ","plæn"],"start":27.934,"end":31.434,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,27.934],[1,28.029],[2,29.46],[3,29.731],[4,30.193],[5,30.438],[6,30.533],[7,30.995]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"Have you bought running shoes?","vi":"Bố mua giày chạy chưa?","ipa":["hæv","ju","bɑt","ˈɹʌnɪŋ","ʃuz"],"start":32.224,"end":33.644,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,32.224],[1,32.325],[2,32.474],[3,32.801],[4,33.113]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Not yet. But I've found a good shop.","vi":"Chưa. Nhưng bố tìm được một cửa hàng tốt rồi.","ipa":["nɑt","jɛt","bʌt","aɪv","faʊnd","ə","ɡʊd","ʃɑp"],"start":34.434,"end":37.604,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,34.434],[1,34.726],[2,36.13],[3,36.361],[4,36.524],[5,36.836],[6,36.931],[7,37.135]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"What about your diet? You love burgers.","vi":"Còn chế độ ăn thì sao? Bố mê burger mà.","ipa":["wʌt","əˈbaʊt","jɔɹ","ˈdaɪət","ju","lʌv","ˈbɝɡɚz"],"start":38.394,"end":41.034,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,38.394],[1,38.505],[2,38.845],[3,38.994],[4,39.986],[5,40.108],[6,40.394]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"I've never eaten so much salad in my life!","vi":"Cả đời bố chưa bao giờ ăn nhiều sa-lát đến thế!","ipa":["aɪv","ˈnɛvɚ","ˈitən","soʊ","mʌtʃ","ˈsæləd","ɪn","maɪ","laɪf"],"start":41.824,"end":44.094,"expression":"tired","timing":[[0,41.824],[1,41.946],[2,42.273],[3,42.517],[4,42.748],[5,42.979],[6,43.414],[7,43.523],[8,43.686]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"Have you ever injured your legs?","vi":"Bố đã bao giờ bị đau chân chưa?","ipa":["hæv","ju","ˈɛvɚ","ˈɪndʒɚd","jɔɹ","lɛɡz"],"start":44.884,"end":46.634,"expression":"worried","timing":[[0,44.884],[1,45.012],[2,45.189],[3,45.474],[4,45.895],[5,46.086]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Never. My legs are strong.","vi":"Chưa bao giờ. Chân bố khoẻ lắm.","ipa":["ˈnɛvɚ","maɪ","lɛɡz","ɑɹ","stɹɔŋ"],"start":47.424,"end":50.344,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,47.424],[1,49.011],[2,49.242],[3,49.622],[4,49.758]]},{"speaker":"chloe","en":"OK. I'll come with you on my bike and check your speed.","vi":"Được rồi. Con sẽ đạp xe đi cùng và theo dõi tốc độ cho bố.","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","aɪl","kʌm","wɪð","ju","ɑn","maɪ","baɪk","ənd","tʃɛk","jɔɹ","spid"],"start":51.134,"end":54.364,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,51.134],[1,51.907],[2,52.043],[3,52.274],[4,52.437],[5,52.6],[6,52.722],[7,52.913],[8,53.266],[9,53.375],[10,53.673],[11,53.796]]},{"speaker":"tom","en":"That's the best idea I've ever heard!","vi":"Đó là ý hay nhất bố từng nghe đấy!","ipa":["ðæts","ðə","bɛst","aɪˈdiə","aɪv","ˈɛvɚ","hɝd"],"start":55.154,"end":57.164,"expression":"happy","gesture":"cheer","react":{"chloe":"happy"},"timing":[[0,55.154],[1,55.351],[2,55.5],[3,55.826],[4,56.248],[5,56.492],[6,56.737]]}],"words":[{"id":"challenge","en":"challenge","ipa":"ˈtʃæləndʒ","vi":"thử thách; thách thức","level":1},{"id":"training","en":"training","ipa":"ˈtɹeɪnɪŋ","vi":"đào tạo; huấn luyện; tập luyện","level":1},{"id":"diet","en":"diet","ipa":"ˈdaɪət","vi":"chế độ ăn; ăn kiêng","level":1},{"id":"injure","en":"injure","ipa":"ˈɪndʒɚ","vi":"làm bị thương; gây tổn thương","level":1},{"id":"speed","en":"speed","ipa":"spid","vi":"tốc độ; vận tốc; phóng nhanh","level":1}],"focus":{"title":"Hỏi và kể về trải nghiệm","pattern":"Have you ever + V3? · I've never + V3. · I've already… · Not yet.","explain":"Hỏi trải nghiệm trong đời (không nói thời điểm) dùng hiện tại hoàn thành: \"Have you ever run…?\". Trả lời: \"Yes, I have.\" / \"No, I've never…\". V3 là quá khứ phân từ (run, eaten, been).","keys":["have you ever","i've never","i've already","not yet"],"lines":[1,2,3,6,8,10,11]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-dads-first-marathon.mp3","v":"0b98536cfd","duration":58.248,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}